"/><figcaption>辭職｜別求安逸，8個訊號告訴你該要轉工（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"辭職｜別求安逸，8個訊號告訴你該要轉工（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220426/595694367315464192290654.jpeg/rPq2LxECYzXLIL_A26VWMkuzTKqBcZ6NdpUuzXaVLs0\"/><figcaption>辭職｜別求安逸，8個訊號告訴你該要轉工（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>【本文獲「Goody25」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-01T08:21:07.798369+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1730,"images":30,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}